                        <div class="entry">罗斯火枪兵的语音专用于射击军<br>
<div class="vl">
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc1">一般命令回应</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/13/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Сделано будет(Sdelano budet) - It will be done.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/8/83/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_istealth_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Будет сделано.(Budet sdelano.) - It shall be done.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/7a/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да.(Da.) - Yes.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/53/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_istealth_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Да.(Da.) - Yes.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/cd/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Тако.(Tako.) - As you command.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/1a/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_istealth_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Непременно.(Nepremenno.) - Without fail.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/5b/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Исполнено будет.(Ispolneno budet.) - It will be carried out.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/6/6f/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_istealth_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Будет исполнено.(Budet ispolneno.) - It will be done.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/5b/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_ihigh_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">С радостию!(S radostiyu!) - With joy!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/08/Rus_handcannon_acknowledge_istealth_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth С удовольствием.(S udovol'stviyem.) - With pleasure.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc2">小队命令回应</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/d2/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Добро есть.(Dobro yest'.) - Very well.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/9/9e/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ладно, есть.(Ladno, yest'.) - Very well, as you wish.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/46/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да(Da) - Yes.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/39/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Благо есть (Blago yest') - Good</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/3a/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Слушаюсь!(Slushayusya!) - At your service!</span>
