        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c3/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_07_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Хорошо(Khorosho) - Good.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/41/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_08_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ладно(Ladno) - All right.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/59/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_09_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да(Da) - Yes.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/41/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_10_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Есть.(Yest'.) - Yes, sir.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/33/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_11_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Слушаюсь!(Slushayus!) - I obey!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/1e/Rus_handcannon_acknowledgegmr_ihigh_chigh_12_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Понял.(Ponyal.) - Understood.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc3">单个单位命令·选择</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/e5/Rus_handcannon_select_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Наказывайте!(Nakazyvayte!) - Give your order!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/eb/Rus_handcannon_select_istealth_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Приказывайте!(Prikazyvayte!) - Command me!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b7/Rus_handcannon_select_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Пищальник ожидает наказы.(Pishchal'nik ozhidayet nakazy.) - The musketeer awaits
                orders.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/f8/Rus_handcannon_select_istealth_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Пищальник ждёт приказаний!(Pishchal'nik zhdyot prikazaniy!) - The musketeer awaits
                command!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/ca/Rus_handcannon_select_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Что накажете?(Chto nakazhete?) - What is your command?</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/14/Rus_handcannon_select_istealth_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth Что прикажете?(Chto prikazhete?) - What do you command?</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/52/Rus_handcannon_select_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">В кого стреляти будете?(V kogo strelyati budete?) - Whom will you shoot at?</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/12/Rus_handcannon_select_istealth_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Stealth В кого изволите стрелять?(V kogo izvolite strelyat'?) - Whom do you wish to
                shoot?</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc4">单个单位命令·移动</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
