            <span class="vt">Ищу ворога! Приступаю!(Ishchu voroga! Pristupayu!) - I seek the enemy! I advance!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
