            <span class="vt">Пищальники, спешите!(Pishchal'niki, speshite!) - Musketeers, hurry!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/ce/Rus_handcannon_movesametypegc_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Пищальники, спешите зело!(Pishchal'niki, speshite zelo!) - Musketeers, hurry with all
                speed!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/0c/Rus_handcannon_movesametypegc_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Воины, идите ко мне!(Voiny, idite ko mne!) - Warriors, come to me!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc9">同类单位小队命令·攻击</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/19/Rus_handcannon_attacksametypegc_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Пищальники, сокрушайте!(Pishchal'niki, sokrushayte!) - Musketeers, crush them!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/df/Rus_handcannon_attacksametypegc_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/4e/Rus_handcannon_attacksametypegc_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Стреляйте в ворога, блядове!(Strelyayte v voroga, blyadove!) - Shoot the enemy, you
                bastards!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc10">混合单位小队命令·选择</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/5d/Rus_handcannon_selectgc_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Слушайте наказ, воины!(Slushayte nakaz, voiny!) - Hear the order, warriors!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/e9/Rus_handcannon_selectgc_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да не празднуйте, наказ слушайте!(Da ne prazdnuyte, nakaz slushayte!) - Do not idle — hear
                the order!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/6/6b/Rus_handcannon_selectgc_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Внемлите! Наказ новый суть.(Vnemlite! Nakaz novyy sut'.) - Heed! There is a new
                order.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b0/Rus_handcannon_selectgc_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Наказ новый есть, воины!(Nakaz novyy yest', voiny!) - There is a new order,
                warriors!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc11">混合单位小队命令·移动</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b2/Rus_handcannon_movegc_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Поспешите, леностные!(Pospeshite, lenostnyye!) - Hurry, you lazy ones!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/e2/Rus_handcannon_movegc_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Воины, наказано идти.(Voiny, nakazano idti.) - Warriors, we are ordered to march.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/21/Rus_handcannon_movegc_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Идём.(Idyom.) - We go.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/2d/Rus_handcannon_movegc_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Велено прийти на прежь.(Veleno priyti na prezh'.) - We are ordered to come to the
                front.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc12">混合单位小队命令·移动攻击</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/0f/Rus_handcannon_attackmovegc_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Оружие готово есть.(Oruzhie gotovo yest'.) - The weapon is ready.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/f5/Rus_handcannon_attackmovegc_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Оружие готово есть. Спешите!(Oruzhie gotovo yest'. Speshite!) - The weapon is ready.
                Hurry!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c8/Rus_handcannon_attackmovegc_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Берите снаряжение, идти приказано!(Berite snaryazhenie, idti prikazano!) - Take the gear —
                we are ordered to march!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/f2/Rus_handcannon_attackmovegc_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Наступаем! Оружие на брань!(Nastupayem! Oruzhie na bran'!) - We advance! Weapons for
                battle!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc13">混合单位小队命令·变换阵型</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c9/Rus_handcannon_changeformation_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/e0/Rus_handcannon_changeformation_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Слушаюсь, меняю строй!(Slushayus', menyayu stroy!) - I obey — I change formation!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c6/Rus_handcannon_changeformation_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Строй будет изменён(Stroy budet izmenyon) - The formation will be changed.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc14">混合单位小队命令·驻扎</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/78/Rus_handcannon_garrison_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Занимаю укрытие!(Zanimayu ukrytie!) - I take cover!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c2/Rus_handcannon_garrison_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Иду в укрытие!(Idu v ukrytie!) - I go to cover!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/78/Rus_handcannon_garrison_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc15">混合单位小队命令·坚守</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/d9/Rus_handcannon_hold_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Буду держать позицию!(Budu derzhat' pozitsiyu!) - I will hold the position!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b2/Rus_handcannon_hold_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Не отступлю ни на шаг!(Ne otstupyu ni na shag!) - I will not retreat a single step!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc16">混合单位小队命令·停止</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/a/ad/Rus_handcannon_stop_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Остановихся, идеже наказано есть.(Ostanovikhsya, idezhe nakazano yest'.) - I have halted
                where ordered.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/51/Rus_handcannon_stop_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Остановихся.(Ostanovikhsya.) - I have halted.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc17">混合单位小队命令·建造攻城器</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/a/a6/Rus_handcannon_structurebuild_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Строю, идеже наказано.(Stroyu, idezhe nakazano.) - I build where ordered.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/f1/Rus_handcannon_structurebuild_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc18">环境语音·进军</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/23/Rus_handcannon_marchingidle_inorm_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Порох и пули суть сухие!(Porokh i puli sut' sukhie!) - Powder and bullets are dry!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c6/Rus_handcannon_marchingidle_inorm_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Порох смердит зело.(Porokh smerdit zelo.) - The powder stinks mightily.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/a/a5/Rus_handcannon_marchingidle_inorm_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ужасаюся. Неужели на брань идём?(Uzhasayusya. Neuzheli na bran' idyom?) - I am terrified.
                Are we really going to battle?</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/8/82/Rus_handcannon_marchingidle_inorm_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/2f/Rus_handcannon_marchingidle_inorm_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Порох и пули — суть други лучшие мне.(Porokh i puli — sut' drugi luchshiye mne.) - Powder
                and bullets are my best friends.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc19">环境语音·作战·兼用</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/4c/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Не отступайте, воины!(Ne otstupayte, voiny!) - Do not retreat, warriors!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/3c/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Притесняйте их!(Pritesnyayte ikh!) - Press them!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/20/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Сокрушай ворога!(Sokrushay voroga!) - Crush the enemy!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/4b/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ежели победим, дома буду!(Yezheli pobedim, doma budem!) - If we win, we shall be
                home!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/39/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/6/6f/Rus_handcannon_ambientcombat_ihigh_chigh_06_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Не сдаются!(Ne sdayutsya!) - They do not surrender!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc20">环境语音·作战·武器瞄准</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/1c/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Приготовляйтеся!(Prigotovlyaytesya!) - Make ready!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/6/65/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Направляйтеся, яко надобно есть!(Napravlyaytesya, yako nadobno yest'!) - Aim as is
                required!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/9/9a/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Воины, избирайте цель!(Voiny, izbirayte tsel'!) - Warriors, choose your target!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/39/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/43/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Направляйте!(Napravlyayte!) - Aim!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/15/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_06_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/06/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_07_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ищем цели!(Ishchem tseli!) - We seek targets!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/71/Rus_handcannon_weaponaim_ihigh_chigh_08_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Цельтесь лучше!(Tsel'tes' luchshe!) - Aim better!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc21">环境语音·作战·武器发射</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/2/24/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Стреляйте, воины храбрые!(Strelyayte, voiny khrabryye!) - Fire, brave warriors!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/bf/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Огонь есть! Направляйте разумно!(Ogon' yest'! Napravlyayte razumno!) - Fire is ready! Aim
                wisely!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/f0/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Направьте их в ад!(Naprav'te ikh v ad!) - Send them to hell!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/9/98/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Огонь есть!(Ogon' yest'!) - Fire is ready!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b9/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Сокрушай ворога!(Sokrushay voroga!) - Crush the enemy!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/5a/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_06_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Бум!(Bum!) - Boom!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/6/65/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_07_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Стреляю!(Strelyayu!) - I fire!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/1/17/Rus_handcannon_weaponfire_ihigh_chigh_08_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Мы несём смерть!(My nesyom smert'!) - We bring death!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc22">环境语音·发现敌人</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/03/Rus_handcannon_enemyspotted_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Вижу их, нечестивых!(Vizhu ikh, nechestivykh!) - I see them — the godless!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/00/Rus_handcannon_enemyspotted_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Обретен есть противный!(Obreten yest' protivnyy!) - The foe is found!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/7d/Rus_handcannon_enemyspotted_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Вижу ворога!(Vizhu voroga!) - I see the enemy!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc23">环境语音·摧毁目标</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/78/Rus_handcannon_targetdestroyed_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ещё один погибе!(Yeshcho odin pogibe!) - Another one has fallen!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/8/8b/Rus_handcannon_targetdestroyed_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Победитель есмь!(Pobeditel' yesm'!) - I am the victor!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/35/Rus_handcannon_targetdestroyed_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Исправно есть!(Ispravno yest'!) - Done properly!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/7/77/Rus_handcannon_targetdestroyed_ihigh_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Победа! Победа славная есть!(Pobeda! Pobeda slavnaya yest'!) - Victory! A glorious
                victory!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc24">环境语音·受到攻击</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/d3/Rus_handcannon_underattack_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">В нас стреляют!(V nas strelyayut!) - They are shooting at us!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/db/Rus_handcannon_underattack_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/a/a0/Rus_handcannon_underattack_ihigh_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt"></span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc25">环境语音·建造攻城器后</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/dd/Rus_handcannon_reactproud_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Задача выполнена!(Zadacha vypolnena!) - The task is complete!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/fe/Rus_handcannon_reactproud_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Теперь работа завершена!(Teper' rabota zavershena!) - Now the work is finished!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc26">环境语音·庆祝</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/a/ab/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Хо-хо-хо-хо-хо!(Kho-kho-kho-kho-kho!) - Ho-ho-ho-ho-ho!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/d/dd/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да!(Da!) - Yes!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/0/0b/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_03_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Радость!(Radost'!) - Joy!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/e/eb/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_04_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Предобра весть!(Predobra vest'!) - Wonderful news!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/3/31/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_05_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Благо вельми есть!(Blago vel'mi yest'!) - It is exceedingly good!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/4/45/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_06_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Ура!(Ura!) - Hooray!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/f/fd/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_07_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Да!(Da!) - Yes!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/5/59/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_08_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Успех!(Uspekh!) - Success!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/b3/Rus_handcannon_celebrate_inorm_chigh_09_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Превосходно!(Prevoskhodno!) - Excellent!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section>
        <h3 class="vc" id="vc27">语音·狩猎</h3>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/b/bb/Rus_handcannon_resourcehunt_ihigh_chigh_01_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Охочус на зверя!(Okhochus' na zverya!) - I am hunting the beast!</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
        <div class="vr">
            <button class="vp" type="button" aria-label="Play voice"
                data-a="https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ageofempires/images/c/c9/Rus_handcannon_resourcehunt_ihigh_chigh_02_mp3.mp3"></button>
            <span class="vt">Иду охотиться.(Idu okhotit'sya.) - I go hunting.</span>
            <span class="va">Ⅳ</span>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>

